                <pb facs="0139" n="133" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg133"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr. Dun.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-11-22"><hi rendition="#italic">November 22,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>It is reported that American and Canadian seal fishery vessels may be placed
                    under the Japanese flag next season. Comity will naturally counsel Japanese
                    Government to defeat any such attempted abuse of friendly flag to evade results
                    of Paris Arbitration.</p>
            </div>
